9-6e42-55a8-9e12-efe44e59e72b"] [17592186204026 :knowledge-point/questions "question-ce47ce1b-5e64-5fb8-88b0-27f2349480f8"] ["question-d0e5e71c-da68-5727-a150-890764f120a1" :question/id #uuid "d0e5e71c-da68-5727-a150-890764f120a1"] ["question-d0e5e71c-da68-5727-a150-890764f120a1" :question/math-academy-id "q-257201"] ["question-d0e5e71c-da68-5727-a150-890764f120a1" :question/problem "Suppose we wish to find a critical point of the function $f(x,y)$ in the region $[0,1]\\times [1,2]⊆{R}^{2},$ where\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=4x{y}^{2}+3{x}^{2}-6xy-x.\n$$\n\nFill in the blanks in the matrix equation below that defines the first iteration of the Newton-Raphson process starting at the point $[1,\\,2]^{T}.$\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"1\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">$[$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">$10$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">$]({x}_{1}-{x}_{0})\\,=[$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">$-9$</td>\n<td align=\"left\" rowspan=\"2\">$]$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">$10$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">\n{{field-3}}\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>"] ["question-d0e5e71c-da68-5727-a150-890764f120a1" :question/worked-solution "The Newton-Raphson method of optimizing a multivariable function $f:{R}^{n}\\to R$ is\n\n$$\n{x}_{n+1}={x}_{n}-[{H}_{f}({x}_{n})]^{-1}∇f({x}_{n}),\n$$\n\nwhere $H({x}_{n})$ and $∇f({x}_{n})$ are the Hessian and gradient of $f$, respectively, evaluated at ${x}_{n}.$\n\nEquivalently, at each iteration, the above equation can be rewritten as\n\n$$\n{H}_{f}({x}_{n})({x}_{n+1}-{x}_{n})=-∇f({x}_{n}).\n$$\n\nIn our case, the gradient is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂x}(4x{y}^{2}+3{x}^{2}-6xy-x) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂y}(4x{y}^{2}+3{x}^{2}-6xy-x)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4{y}^{2}+6x-6y-1 \\\\ 8xy-6x\\end{aligned}],\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand the Hessian is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{H}_{f}(x) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂x}(4{y}^{2}+6x-6y-1) & \\frac{∂}{∂x}(8xy-6x) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂y}(4{y}^{2}+6x-6y-1) & \\frac{∂}{∂y}(8xy-6x)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}6 & 8y-6 \\\\ 8y-6 & 8x\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our Newton-Raphson system of equations is\n\n$$\n{[\\begin{aligned}6 & 8y-6 \\\\ 8y-6 & 8x\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{n}}({x}_{n+1}-{x}_{n})=-{[\\begin{aligned}4{y}^{2}+6x-6y-1 \\\\ 8xy-6x\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{n}}.\n$$\n\nStarting with ${x}_{0}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}],$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{[\\begin{aligned}6 & 8y-6 \\\\ 8y-6 & 8x\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{0}}({x}_{1}-{x}_{0}) & =-{[\\begin{aligned}4{y}^{2}+6x-6y-1 \\\\ 8xy-6x\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{0}} \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}6 & 8(2)-6 \\\\ 8(2)-6 & 8(1)\\end{aligned}]({x}_{1}-{x}_{0}) & =-[\\begin{aligned}4(2)^{2}+6(1)-6(2)-1 \\\\ 8(1)(2)-6(1)\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}6 & 10 \\\\ 10 & 8\\end{aligned}]({x}_{1}-{x}_{0}) & =[\\begin{aligned}-9 \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-d0e5e71c-da68-5727-a150-890764f120a1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-d16c318b-433e-5219-bbac-c0dceacd735f" :answer-field/id #uuid "d16c318b-433e-5219-bbac-c0dceacd735f"] ["answer-d355a1ab-4760-5da8-81c8-ff82042eba6d" :answer/id #uuid "d355a1ab-4760-5da8-81c8-ff82042eba6d"] ["answer-d355a1ab-4760-5da8-81c8-ff82042eba6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d355a1ab-4760-5da8-81c8-ff82042eba6d" :answer/value "6"] ["answer-field-d16c318b-433e-5219-bbac-c0dceacd735f" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-d16c318b-433e-5219-bbac-c0dceacd735f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-d16c318b-433e-5219-bbac-c0dceacd735f" :answer-field/correct "answer-d355a1ab-4760-5da8-81c8-ff82042eba6d"] ["answer-field-d16c318b-433e-5219-bbac-c0dceacd735f" :answer-field/choices "answer-d355a1ab-4760-5da8-81c8-ff82042eba6d"] ["answer-field-65b0c455-67d2-5558-afa0-2900b8085ad6" :answer-field/id #uuid "65b0c455-67d2-5558-afa0-2900b8085ad6"] ["answer-87cb53ab-6033-5d2e-a880-f4c5d0d8a4db" :answer/id #uuid "87cb53ab-6033-5d2e-a880-f4c5d0d8a4db"] ["answer-87cb53ab-6033-5d2e-a880-f4c5d0d8a4db" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-87cb53ab-6033-5d2e-a880-f4c5d0d8a4db" :answer/value "8"] ["answer-field-65b0c455-67d2-5558-afa0-2900b8085ad6" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-65b0c455-67d2-5558-afa0-2900b8085ad6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-65b0c455-67d2-5558-afa0-2900b8085ad6" :answer-field/correct "answer-87cb53ab-6033-5d2e-a880-f4c5d0d8a4db"] ["answer-field-65b0c455-67d2-5558-afa0-2900b8085ad6" :answer-field/choices "answer-87cb53ab-6033-5d2e-a880-f4c5d0d8a4db"] ["answer-field-002ec56f-2448-5134-85e4-8cbe3fa3a022" :answer-field/id #uuid "002ec56f-2448-5134-85e4-8cbe3fa3a022"] ["answer-2d1cb510-1818-547a-8900-e0080154ff41" :answer/id #uuid "2d1cb510-1818-547a-8900-e0080154ff41"] ["answer-2d1cb510-1818-547a-8900-e0080154ff41" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2d1cb510-1818-547a-8900-e0080154ff41" :answer/value "-10"] ["answer-field-002ec56f-2448-5134-85e4-8cbe3fa3a022" :answer-field/key "field-3"] ["answer-field-002ec56f-2448-5134-85e4-8cbe3fa3a022" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-002ec56f-2448-5134-85e4-8cbe3fa3a022" :answer-field/correct "answer-2d1cb510-1818-547a-8900-e0080154ff41"] ["answer-field-002ec56f-2448-5134-85e4-8cbe3fa3a022" :answer-field/choices "answer-2d1cb510-1818-547a-8900-e0080154ff41"] ["question-d0e5e71c-da68-5727-a150-890764f120a1" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-d16c318b-433e-5219-bbac-c0dceacd735f"] ["question-d0e5e71c-da68-5727-a150-890764f120a1" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-65b0c455-67d2-5558-afa0-2900b8085ad6"] ["question-d0e5e71c-da68-5727-a150-890764f120a1" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-002ec56f-2448-5134-85e4-8cbe3fa3a022"] [17592186204026 :knowledge-point/questions "question-d0e5e71c-da68-5727-a150-890764f120a1"] ["question-4033d90f-6820-5b6e-97e2-e268a68a992f" :question/id #uuid "4033d90f-6820-5b6e-97e2-e268a68a992f"] ["question-4033d90f-6820-5b6e-97e2-e268a68a992f" :question/math-academy-id "q-257215"] ["question-4033d90f-6820-5b6e-97e2-e268a68a992f" :question/problem "Suppose we wish to find a critical point of the function $f(x,y)$ in the region $[-1,0]\\times [0,1]⊆{R}^{2},$ where\n\n$$\nf(x,y)={x}^{3}-2x{y}^{2}-xy+x-y.\n$$\n\nFill in the blanks in the matrix equation below that defines the first iteration of the Newton-Raphson process starting at the point $[-1,\\,1]^{T},$ and compute the components of the first iteration. Round the answer for ${x}_{1}$ to **three decimal places**.\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"1\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">$[$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">\n$-5$\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">$]({x}_{1}-{x}_{0})\\,=[$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">\n$-1$\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\" rowspan=\"2\">$]$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">\n$-5$\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">{{field-3}}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"1\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">${x}_{1}≈[$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">$-0.510$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">$]$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">\n{{field-4}}\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>"] ["question-4033d90f-6820-5b6e-97e2-e268a68a992f" :question/worked-solution "The Newton-Raphson method of optimizing a multivariable function $f:{R}^{n}\\to R$ is\n\n$$\n{x}_{n+1}={x}_{n}-[{H}_{f}({x}_{n})]^{-1}∇f({x}_{n}),\n$$\n\nwhere $H({x}_{n})$ and $∇f({x}_{n})$ are the Hessian and gradient of $f$, respectively, evaluated at ${x}_{n}.$\n\nEquivalently, at each iteration, the above equation can be rewritten as\n\n$$\n{H}_{f}({x}_{n})({x}_{n+1}-{x}_{n})=-∇f({x}_{n}).\n$$\n\nIn our case, the gradient is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{3}-2x{y}^{2}-xy+x-y) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{3}-2x{y}^{2}-xy+x-y)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}-y+1 \\\\ -4xy-x-1\\end{aligned}],\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand the Hessian is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{H}_{f}(x) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂x}(3{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}-y+1) & \\frac{∂}{∂x}(-4xy-x-1) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂y}(3{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}-y+1) & \\frac{∂}{∂y}(-4xy-x-1)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}6x & -4y-1 \\\\ -4y-1 & -4x\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our Newton-Raphson system of equations is\n\n$$\n{[\\begin{aligned}6x & -4y-1 \\\\ -4y-1 & -4x\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{n}}({x}_{n+1}-{x}_{n})=-{[\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}-y+1 \\\\ -4xy-x-1\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{n}}.\n$$\n\nStarting with ${x}_{0}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{[\\begin{aligned}6x & -4y-1 \\\\ -4y-1 & -4x\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{0}}({x}_{1}-{x}_{0}) & =-{[\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}-y+1 \\\\ -4xy-x-1\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{0}} \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}6(-1) & -4(1)-1 \\\\ -4(1)-1 & -4(-1)\\end{aligned}]({x}_{1}-{x}_{0}) & =-[\\begin{aligned}3(-1)^{2}-2(1)^{2}-1+1 \\\\ -4(-1)(1)-(-1)-1\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-6 & -5 \\\\ -5 & 4\\end{aligned}]({x}_{1}-{x}_{0}) & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this system of equations, we get $({x}_{1}-{x}_{0})=[\\begin{aligned}24/49 \\\\ -19/49\\end{aligned}].$ Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & ={x}_{0}+[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{24}{49} \\\\ -\\frac{19}{49}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{24}{49} \\\\ -\\frac{19}{49}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ≈[\\begin{aligned}-0.510 \\\\ 0.612\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-4033d90f-6820-5b6e-97e2-e268a68a992f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-1efb643c-734b-58b8-990d-a15c076650e6" :answer-field/id #uuid "1efb643c-734b-58b8-990d-a15c076650e6"] ["answer-0b968de3-48ac-5509-bda5-bdd182bb0096" :answer/id #uuid "0b968de3-48ac-5509-bda5-bdd182bb0096"] ["answer-0b968de3-48ac-5509-bda5-bdd182bb0096" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0b968de3-48ac-5509-bda5-bdd182bb0096" :answer/value "-6"] ["answer-field-1efb643c-734b-58b8-990d-a15c076650e6" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-1efb643c-734b-58b8-990d-a15c076650e6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-1efb643c-734b-58b8-990d-a15c076650e6" :answer-field/correct "answer-0b968de3-48ac-5509-bda5-bdd182bb0096"] ["answer-field-1efb643c-734b-58b8-990d-a15c076650e6" :answer-field/choices "answer-0b968de3-48ac-5509-bda5-bdd182bb0096"] ["answer-field-51ef4741-c3ce-5d22-a88d-9e3bfc963ad1" :answer-field/id #uuid "51ef4741-c3ce-5d22-a88d-9e3bfc963ad1"] ["answer-c5cde4ac-83ff-571c-bb29-6811f5eb0038" :answer/id #uuid "c5cde4ac-83ff-571c-bb29-6811f5eb0038"] ["answer-c5cde4ac-83ff-571c-bb29-6811f5eb0038" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c5cde4ac-83ff-571c-bb29-6811f5eb0038" :answer/value "4"] ["answer-field-51ef4741-c3ce-5d22-a88d-9e3bfc963ad1" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-51ef4741-c3ce-5d22-a88d-9e3bfc963ad1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-51ef4741-c3ce-5d22-a88d-9e3bfc963ad1" :answer-field/correct "answer-c5cde4ac-83ff-571c-bb29-6811f5eb0038"] ["answer-field-51ef4741-c3ce-5d22-a88d-9e3bfc963ad1" :answer-field/choices "answer-c5cde4ac-83ff-571c-bb29-6811f5eb0038"] ["answer-field-a8074289-ced7-55df-b16d-486ca5eaf823" :answer-field/id #uuid "a8074289-ced7-55df-b16d-486ca5eaf823"] ["answer-60130157-f623-5097-835c-7ab98079c34b" :answer/id #uuid "60130157-f6